{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09283","headline":"送终 · 韦应物","name":"送终","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奄忽逾时节，日月获其良。\n萧萧车马悲，祖载发中堂。\n生平同此居，一旦异存亡。\n斯须亦何益，终复委山冈。\n行出国南门，南望郁苍苍。\n日入乃云造，恸哭宿风霜。\n晨迁俯玄庐，临诀但遑遑。\n方当永潜翳，仰视白日光。\n俯仰遽终毕，封树已荒凉。\n独留不得还，欲去结中肠。\n童稚知所失，啼号捉我裳。\n既事犹仓卒，岁月始难忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}